    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Located here: <A href="http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/89"><FONT color=#000080>http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/89</FONT></A></P>
<P>Based upon this: <A href="http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/20">http://bigfix.me/cdb/analysis/20</A><BR><BR>Pull back status on the PowerShell installation on this system.</P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>exists key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\PowerShell\1&quot; whose (value &quot;Install&quot; of it as integer = 1) of registry</Relevance>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
